":2},"text":"马斯克周\n\n如果要说过去的一星期是“马斯克周”，估计没人反对吧。\n\n首先，是乌克兰方面的问题，\n\n当俄乌双方都违背川普的要求继续攻击对方的柴油生产设备时，乌克兰方面忽然宣布，他们的星链系统，出现了速度方面的问题。一瞬间，全球都在质疑马斯克。","url":"https://x.com/jayzhenghere/status/2111977518488338555"},{"author_id":"2048345658520932352","created_at":"2026-10-19T01:45:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111997181519638574"],"id":"2111997181519638574","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":995,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"医疗AI，详细分析10家有代表性的企业：\n\n1. 科大讯飞：","url":"https://x.com/Deelu179242/status/2111997181519638574"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2112007525734432768"]},"author_id":"1157465882064371712","created_at":"2026-10-19T02:31:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112008668774617176"],"id":"2112008668774617176","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":488,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"马斯克最新央视专访：\n\n未来10年，人类社会可能被彻底改写。26分钟，20个话题，从中国制造、AI、机器人，一直聊到火星和人类文明。\n\n其中几个预测相当激进：\n\n10年内，人形机器人突破10亿台\n15年后，机器人可能达到100亿台\nAI将推动人类进入「普遍高收入」时代\n未来，钱可能不再重要 https://t.co/MXxleiJk3Q","url":"https://x.com/Untethered_X/status/2112008668774617176"},{"author_id":"630281739","created_at":"2026-10-18T22:19:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111945371492696071"],"id":"2111945371492696071","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Check out Canon BCI-3e Cyan Ink Cartridge 4480A003 Genuine - New Sealed Box https://t.co/PeZuG3J2aW #eBay via @eBay","url":"https://x.com/MerrilyVerilyVi/status/2111945371492696071"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2111938307785445376"]},"author_id":"1794498130659942401","created_at":"2026-10-18T21:51:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111938334180176384"],"id":"2111938334180176384","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":64,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"New in PiEEG Cloud: the Oculomotor,